{"code":"bn","name":"Bengali","native":"বাংলা","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, future, postpositions, food","goals":["Talk about past and future correctly","Use কে/থেকে/র/এ in places","Order food and shop with prices"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and future","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past: খেলাম + ছিল","learn":"Past is simple! খেলাম (I ate), খেলে (you ate), খেল (he/she ate), খেলেন (formal ate)! ছিল = was: আমি খুশি ছিলাম (I was happy)! No gender, no ergative — just endings!","vocab":[{"t":"গতকাল","r":"gôtokal","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"আজ","r":"aj","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"আগামীকাল","r":"agamikal","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"সকাল","r":"shôkal","en":"morning","pos":"noun"},{"t":"সন্ধ্যা","r":"shondha","en":"evening","pos":"noun"},{"t":"রাত","r":"rat","en":"night","pos":"noun"},{"t":"তারপর","r":"tarpôr","en":"then","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"আগে","r":"age","en":"before","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-লাম/-লে/-ল/-লেন · ছিল","explain":"খেলাম (I ate), খেলে (you ate), খেল (he/she ate), খেলেন (formal). ছিলাম/ছিলে/ছিল (was)! গতকাল খেলাম = yesterday I ate!","pattern":"লাম/লে/ল/লেন · ছিল","examples":[{"t":"গতকাল ভাত খেলাম।","r":"gôtokal bhat khelam.","en":"Yesterday I ate rice."},{"t":"সে গেল।","r":"she gælo.","en":"He/she went."},{"t":"আমি খুশি ছিলাম।","r":"ami khushi chhilam.","en":"I was happy."}],"mistakes":["Saying খেয়েছি for simple past — simple: খেলাম!","Saying খেলেন for friends — friends: খেলে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"গতকাল তুমি কী করলে?","r":"gôtokal tumi ki kôrle?","en":"What did you do yesterday? (casual)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"পড়লাম, তারপর খেললাম।","r":"pôṛlam, tarpôr khellam.","en":"I studied, then played."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমি কাজ করলাম।","r":"ami kaj kôrlam.","en":"I worked."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"খুব ভালো!","r":"khub bhalo!","en":"Very good!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I ate rice","answer":"গতকাল ভাত খেলাম"},{"type":"fill","q":"সে ___। (went)","answer":"গেল"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I was happy' is…","options":["আমি খুশি আছি","আমি খুশি ছিলাম","আমি খুশি থাকবো","আমি খুশি হই"],"answer":"আমি খুশি ছিলাম"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: খেলাম / ভাত / গতকাল","answer":"গতকাল ভাত খেলাম"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: গতকাল ভাত খেলাম।","answer":"গতকাল ভাত খেলাম।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"খেলাম means…","options":["you ate","I ate","he ate","we ate"],"answer":1,"why":"-লাম = I-past."},{"q":"ছিলাম means…","options":["am","was (I)","will be","were"],"answer":1,"why":"ছিলাম = was-I."},{"q":"গতকাল means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"গতকাল = yesterday."},{"q":"খেলেন is for…","options":["friends","formal/elders","kids","self"],"answer":1,"why":"-লেন = formal."},{"q":"তারপর means…","options":["before","then","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"তারপর = then."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["yesterday","then","before"],"key":["গতকাল","তারপর","আগে"]},{"instruction":"Make pasts.","items":["Yesterday I ate rice","He/she went","I was happy"],"key":["গতকাল ভাত খেলাম","সে গেল","আমি খুশি ছিলাম"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["What did you do yesterday? (casual)","Very good!"],"key":["গতকাল তুমি কী করলে","খুব ভালো"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"Future: খাবো/খাবে","learn":"Future adds -ব! খাবো (I will eat), খাবে (you/he will eat), খাবেন (formal will eat)! আগামীকাল = tomorrow. শীঘ্রই দেখা হবে! = See you soon!","vocab":[{"t":"শীঘ্রই","r":"shighroi","en":"soon","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"পরে","r":"pôre","en":"later","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"এক ঘণ্টায়","r":"æk ghônṭay","en":"in an hour","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"আগামী সপ্তাহে","r":"agami shôptahe","en":"next week","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"সোমবারে","r":"shombare","en":"on Monday","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"সবসময়","r":"shôbshômôy","en":"always","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"মাঝে মাঝে","r":"majhe majhe","en":"sometimes","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"কখনো না","r":"kôkhono na","en":"never","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-বো/-বে/-বেন","explain":"খাবো (I will eat), খাবে (you/he will eat), খাবেন (formal). বাংলা শিখবো (I will learn Bengali)!","pattern":"বো (I) · বে (you/he) · বেন (formal)","examples":[{"t":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো।","r":"ami bangla shikhbo.","en":"I will learn Bengali."},{"t":"আমরা বলবো!","r":"amra bôlbo!","en":"We will speak!"},{"t":"সে খাবে।","r":"she khabe.","en":"He/she will eat."}],"mistakes":["Saying খাবেন for friends — friends: খাবে!","Saying খাবো for he — he: খাবে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আগামীকাল তুমি কী করবে?","r":"agamikal tumi ki kôrbe?","en":"What will you do tomorrow? (casual)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো। আর তুমি?","r":"ami bangla shikhbo. ar tumi?","en":"I will learn Bengali. And you?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি কাজ করবো, তারপর খেলবো।","r":"ami kaj kôrbo, tarpôr khelbo.","en":"I will work, then play."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"শীঘ্রই দেখা হবে!","r":"shighroi dekha hôbe!","en":"See you soon!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will learn Bengali","answer":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমরা ___! (will speak)","answer":"বলবো"},{"type":"choose","q":"'He/she will eat' is…","options":["সে খাবো","সে খাবে","সে খাবেন","সে খায়"],"answer":"সে খাবে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: শিখবো / বাংলা / আমি","answer":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমি বাংলা শিখবো।","answer":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"খাবো means…","options":["I eat","I will eat","I ate","I can eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-বো = future-I."},{"q":"খাবেন means…","options":["he will eat","formal will eat","I will eat","they will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-বেন = formal."},{"q":"শীঘ্রই means…","options":["later","soon","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"শীঘ্রই = soon."},{"q":"কখনো না means…","options":["sometimes","always","never","soon"],"answer":2,"why":"কখনো না = never."},{"q":"আমরা takes…","options":["-বে","-বো","-বেন","-বি"],"answer":1,"why":"আমরা + বো."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Future worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["soon","always","never"],"key":["শীঘ্রই","সবসময়","কখনো না"]},{"instruction":"Make futures.","items":["I will learn","He/she will eat","We will speak"],"key":["আমি শিখবো","সে খাবে","আমরা বলবো"]},{"instruction":"Plan tomorrow.","items":["What will you do tomorrow? (casual)","See you soon!"],"key":["আগামীকাল তুমি কী করবে","শীঘ্রই দেখা হবে"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Postpositions","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"কে/থেকে/র + আমাকে","learn":"Glue words AFTER! কে (to), থেকে (from), র/এর (of): আমার বাড়ি (my house), তোমার বই (your book)! আমাকে = to-me: আমাকে জল দাও (give me water)!","vocab":[{"t":"শহর","r":"shôhôr","en":"city","pos":"noun"},{"t":"রাস্তা","r":"rasta","en":"street","pos":"noun"},{"t":"দোকান","r":"dokan","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"কাজ","r":"kaj","en":"work","pos":"noun"},{"t":"পার্ক","r":"park","en":"park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"জাদুঘর","r":"jadughôr","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"স্টেশন","r":"sṭeshon","en":"station","pos":"noun"},{"t":"আমাকে","r":"amake","en":"to me","pos":"pronoun"}],"grammar":{"title":"কে · থেকে · র/এর","explain":"বাড়িতে (to/at home), বাড়ি থেকে (from home), বাড়ির (of the house). আমার (my), তোমার (your-casual), আপনার (your-formal)!","pattern":"X + কে/থেকে/র · আমাকে/তোমাকে","examples":[{"t":"আমি স্কুলে যাই।","r":"ami skule jai.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"আমাকে জল দাও।","r":"amake jôl dao.","en":"Give me water. (casual)"},{"t":"এটা আমার বই।","r":"æṭa amar boi.","en":"This is my book."}],"mistakes":["Saying আমি কে — to-me is আমাকে!","Saying তুমি বই — your: তোমার!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তুমি কোথায় যাও?","r":"tumi kothay jao?","en":"Where do you go? (casual)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমি স্কুলে যাই। আর তুমি?","r":"ami skule jai. ar tumi?","en":"I go to school. And you?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি দোকানে যাই।","r":"ami dokane jai.","en":"I go to the shop."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"ভালো!","r":"bhalo!","en":"Nice!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (casual): Give me water","answer":"আমাকে জল দাও"},{"type":"fill","q":"এটা ___ বই। (my)","answer":"আমার"},{"type":"choose","q":"'To me' is…","options":["আমি কে","আমাকে","আমার","আমিতে"],"answer":"আমাকে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: দাও / জল / আমাকে","answer":"আমাকে জল দাও"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমাকে জল দাও।","answer":"আমাকে জল দাও।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার বই uses আমার because…","options":["plural","my (of-me)","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"আমার = of-me = my."},{"q":"আমাকে means…","options":["I","to me","my","with me"],"answer":1,"why":"আমা + কে = আমাকে."},{"q":"থেকে means…","options":["to","from","of","in"],"answer":1,"why":"থেকে = from."},{"q":"বাড়ির means…","options":["to home","of the house","from home","at home"],"answer":1,"why":"র = of."},{"q":"তোমাকে means…","options":["you","to you (casual)","your","with you"],"answer":1,"why":"তোমা + কে."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Postpositions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["city","shop","to me"],"key":["শহর","দোকান","আমাকে"]},{"instruction":"র/এর + আমাকে.","items":["This is my book","Give me water (casual)","I go to school"],"key":["এটা আমার বই","আমাকে জল দাও","আমি স্কুলে যাই"]},{"instruction":"Going places.","items":["Where do you go? (casual)","I go to the shop"],"key":["তুমি কোথায় যাও","আমি দোকানে যাই"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"এ/তে + কোথায়/কোনদিকে","learn":"BEING vs GOING! এ/তে (in/at/on): বাড়িতে (at home), টেবিলে (on the table). কোথায়? = where, কোনদিকে? = which way! আমি ঢাকায় থাকি (I live in Dhaka)!","vocab":[{"t":"ঢাকা","r":"Ḍhaka","en":"Dhaka","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বাংলাদেশ","r":"Bangladesh","en":"Bangladesh","pos":"noun"},{"t":"অফিস","r":"ôfish","en":"office","pos":"noun"},{"t":"টেবিল","r":"ṭebil","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"পাঠ","r":"paṭh","en":"lesson","pos":"noun"},{"t":"পার্টি","r":"parṭi","en":"party","pos":"noun"},{"t":"সিনেমা","r":"sinema","en":"cinema","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বাড়ি","r":"baṛi","en":"house","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"এ/তে · কোথায়/কোনদিকে","explain":"আমি বাড়িতে আছি (I'm at home), বই টেবিলে আছে (book is on the table). কোথায় থাকো? (where do you live?), স্কুল কোনদিকে? (which way is school?)!","pattern":"এ/তে (in/at/on) · কোথায়/কোনদিকে","examples":[{"t":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি।","r":"ami Ḍhakay thaki.","en":"I live in Dhaka."},{"t":"বই টেবিলে আছে।","r":"boi ṭebile achhe.","en":"The book is on the table."},{"t":"স্কুল কোনদিকে?","r":"skul kondike?","en":"Which way is the school?"}],"mistakes":["Saying বাড়ি for 'at home' — at-home: বাড়িতে!","Saying কোথায় for directions — ways: কোনদিকে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"তুমি কোথায় থাকো?","r":"tumi kothay thako?","en":"Where do you live? (casual)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি। আর তুমি?","r":"ami Ḍhakay thaki. ar tumi?","en":"I live in Dhaka. And you?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমিও ঢাকায়!","r":"amio Ḍhakay!","en":"Me too, in Dhaka!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"খুব ভালো!","r":"khub bhalo!","en":"Excellent!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I live in Dhaka","answer":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি"},{"type":"fill","q":"বই টেবিল___ আছে। (on)","answer":"এ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Which way is the school?' is…","options":["স্কুল কোথায়","স্কুল কোনদিকে","স্কুল কেমন","স্কুল কী"],"answer":"স্কুল কোনদিকে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: থাকি / ঢাকায় / আমি","answer":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমি ঢাকায় থাকি।","answer":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"তে means…","options":["to","in/at/on","from","with"],"answer":1,"why":"তে = in/at/on."},{"q":"কোনদিকে asks…","options":["where-being","which-way","when","why"],"answer":1,"why":"কোনদিকে = which direction."},{"q":"ঢাকায় থাকি means…","options":["go to Dhaka","live in Dhaka","see Dhaka","like Dhaka"],"answer":1,"why":"থাকি = live/stay."},{"q":"বাংলাদেশ means…","options":["Dhaka","Bangladesh","city","home"],"answer":1,"why":"বাংলাদেশ = Bangladesh."},{"q":"টেবিলে আছে means…","options":["under table","on the table","near table","my table"],"answer":1,"why":"টেবিলে = on-table."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"এ/তে worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["Dhaka","table","house"],"key":["ঢাকা","টেবিল","বাড়ি"]},{"instruction":"এ/তে/কোনদিকে.","items":["I live in Dhaka","The book is on the table","Which way is the school?"],"key":["আমি ঢাকায় থাকি","বই টেবিলে আছে","স্কুল কোনদিকে"]},{"instruction":"Where?","items":["Where do you live? (casual)","Excellent!"],"key":["তুমি কোথায় থাকো","খুব ভালো"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"ভালো লাগে and দরকার","learn":"LIKES flip! আমার চা ভালো লাগে = To-me tea feels-good = I like tea. NEEDS: আমার জল দরকার = I need water. The THING is the star: আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে!","vocab":[{"t":"রুটি","r":"ruṭi","en":"bread","pos":"noun"},{"t":"দুধ","r":"dudh","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"পনির","r":"ponir","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"সবজি","r":"shobji","en":"vegetables","pos":"noun"},{"t":"মাছ","r":"machh","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"আপেল","r":"apel","en":"apple","pos":"noun"},{"t":"চা","r":"cha","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"কফি","r":"kôphi","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"আমার X ভালো লাগে · দরকার","explain":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে (I like cheese), আমার চা দরকার (I need tea). Plural: আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে!","pattern":"আমার + thing + ভালো লাগে/দরকার","examples":[{"t":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।","r":"amar ponir bhalo lage.","en":"I like cheese."},{"t":"আমার চা দরকার!","r":"amar cha dôrkar!","en":"I need tea!"},{"t":"আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে।","r":"amar boigulo bhalo lage.","en":"I like books."}],"mistakes":["Saying আমি ভালো লাগি — likes: আমার…ভালো লাগে!","Saying আমার চায় দরকার — দরকার takes plain nouns!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তোমার কী ভালো লাগে?","r":"tomar ki bhalo lage?","en":"What do you like? (casual)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমার পনির আর রুটি ভালো লাগে!","r":"amar ponir ar ruṭi bhalo lage!","en":"I like cheese and bread!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমার মাছ ভালো লাগে। আমার চা দরকার!","r":"amar machh bhalo lage. amar cha dôrkar!","en":"I like fish. I need tea!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমারও কফি দরকার!","r":"amaro kôphi dôrkar!","en":"I need coffee too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like cheese","answer":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমার চা ___! (need)","answer":"দরকার"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I like books' is…","options":["আমি বই ভালো লাগি","আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে","আমার বই ভালো লাগে না","আমি বইগুলোকে ভালোবাসি"],"answer":"আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: লাগে / ভালো / পনির / আমার","answer":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।","answer":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার চা ভালো লাগে means…","options":["I want tea","I like tea","I drink tea","I see tea"],"answer":1,"why":"To-me pleasing = I like."},{"q":"দরকার means…","options":["like","need","eat","drink"],"answer":1,"why":"দরকার = need."},{"q":"পনির means…","options":["milk","cheese","butter","curd"],"answer":1,"why":"পনির = cheese."},{"q":"The STAR of ভালো লাগে is…","options":["the person","the thing liked","nobody","always আমি"],"answer":1,"why":"Tea pleases me!"},{"q":"আমারও means…","options":["only me","me too / I also","not me","my own"],"answer":1,"why":"আমার + ও = also."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"ভালো লাগে worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["cheese","fish","tea"],"key":["পনির","মাছ","চা"]},{"instruction":"Like and need.","items":["I like cheese","I like books","I need tea"],"key":["আমার পনির ভালো লাগে","আমার বইগুলো ভালো লাগে","আমার চা দরকার"]},{"instruction":"Ask tastes.","items":["What do you like? (casual)","I need coffee too!"],"key":["তোমার কী ভালো লাগে","আমারও কফি দরকার"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: দাম কত","learn":"Shop in Bengali! দাম কত? (How much?), দামি (expensive), সস্তা (cheap). Money: টাকা (taka). নেবো = I'll take it!","vocab":[{"t":"দাম","r":"dam","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"টাকা","r":"ṭaka","en":"money / taka","pos":"noun"},{"t":"রসিদ","r":"roshid","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ছাড়","r":"chhaṛ","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"দামি","r":"dami","en":"expensive","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"সস্তা","r":"shôsta","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ফ্রি","r":"fri","en":"free","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"বাজার","r":"bajar","en":"market","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"দাম কত? + নেবো","explain":"রুটির দাম কত? (how much is the bread?), একশো টাকা (100 taka). নেবো = I'll take it! দামি! = Expensive!","pattern":"দাম কত? · নেবো","examples":[{"t":"রুটির দাম কত?","r":"ruṭir dam kôto?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"t":"একশো টাকা।","r":"æksho ṭaka.","en":"100 taka."},{"t":"নেবো!","r":"nebo!","en":"I'll take it!"}],"mistakes":["Saying কত দাম without structure — দাম কত?","Saying নিই for future-taking — I'll-take: নেবো!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"রুটির দাম কত?","r":"ruṭir dam kôto?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"একশো টাকা।","r":"æksho ṭaka.","en":"100 taka."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"দামি! পনিরের দাম কত?","r":"dami! ponirer dam kôto?","en":"Expensive! How much is the cheese?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"সস্তা! নেবো!","r":"shôsta! nebo!","en":"Cheap! I'll take it!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is the bread?","answer":"রুটির দাম কত"},{"type":"fill","q":"একশো ___. (taka)","answer":"টাকা"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'll take it!' is…","options":["আমি চাই","নেবো","আমি যাই","আমি খাই"],"answer":"নেবো"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: কত / দাম / রুটির","answer":"রুটির দাম কত"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: রুটির দাম কত?","answer":"রুটির দাম কত?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"দাম কত? means…","options":["How many?","How much?","Where is?","What is?"],"answer":1,"why":"দাম কত = price-how-much."},{"q":"দামি means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"দামি = expensive."},{"q":"সস্তা means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"সস্তা = cheap."},{"q":"ছাড় means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"ছাড় = discount."},{"q":"নেবো means…","options":["I want","I'll take it","I go","I pay"],"answer":1,"why":"নেবো = will-take."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["দাম","ছাড়","সস্তা"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is the bread?","100 taka","I'll take it!"],"key":["রুটির দাম কত","একশো টাকা","নেবো"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Expensive!","Cheap!"],"key":["দামি","সস্তা"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I ate rice","answer":"গতকাল ভাত খেলাম"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I will learn Bengali","answer":"আমি বাংলা শিখবো"},{"type":"choose","q":"'To me'","options":["আমি কে","আমাকে","আমার","আমিতে"],"answer":"আমাকে"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।","answer":"I like cheese."},{"type":"fill","q":"সে ___। (went)","answer":"গেল"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Which way is the school?'","options":["স্কুল কোথায়","স্কুল কোনদিকে","স্কুল কেমন","স্কুল কী"],"answer":"স্কুল কোনদিকে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: থাকি / ঢাকায় / আমি","answer":"আমি ঢাকায় থাকি"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।","answer":"আমার পনির ভালো লাগে।"},{"type":"fill","q":"রুটির দাম ___? (how much)","answer":"কত"},{"type":"choose","q":"সে খাবে।","options":["He will eat","He/she will eat","I will eat","They will eat"],"answer":"He/she will eat"}]}}}